            new ColumnDoc("value", "The statistic's value. Type P: the median across runs of the co-occupancy (intensity of peptidoforms carrying both marks over intensity of those covering both positions), taken only in runs where the doubly marked peptidoform was quantified. NULL on a type-P row means that peptidoform was IDENTIFIED (MS/MS) in the `n` runs but never quantified in any of them: the physical evidence is real and there is no ratio. It never means zero co-occupancy (ptmQtl 012, P13). Other types: NULL where the statistic was not computed.", "float", Enum: null, Identifier: false, Multivalued: false, Unit: null),
