            ["clock_models"] = new TableDoc("ClockModel", "A trained age clock (R9). NOT YET DEFINITION-BACKED (DATAREPO-5); the shape is dataRepo's and the definition is aging's. An age clock is NOT an age effect: an effect is per feature, a clock is a model over many features (benchmark N1), and the definition is explicit that they are different tables for that reason.",
            [
